<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tom Brown started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tom Brown started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Suisse First Boston said Wednesday analyst Mark Fisher had started coverage of Tom Brown Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were up 1/4 to 18.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
